            // from owner (this contract) so that owner functionality is exercised separately. The non-owner negative case
            // cannot be executed from here because msg.sender is fixed, so the property will assert that only the owner can
            // withdraw by observing that when this contract (owner) calls withdraw it does not revert.
            try c.withdrawAll() {
                withdrewReverted = false;
            } catch {
                withdrewReverted = true;
