    // deposits by using sendMoney to send Ether from C to another address — but sendMoney is only callable by owner and sends out of C.
    // To create a meaningful property involving withdrawAll, we will first ensure this contract is the owner by construction
    // (the checker deploys c with owner = msg.sender i.e., the deployer; here the test contract is deployed with that c already created,
